  "prompt": "For each signup country (signups.country_code), how many users signed up for Mailvora in each quarter of 2025, how many in the whole year, and what share of the year's signups came in the fourth quarter? signup_ts holds UTC time: take the quarter in UTC. Return seven columns, in this order: country_code, q1, q2, q3, q4, total and q4_share_pct, the fourth quarter as a percentage of the year's total (12.5 for 12.5%), rounded to 1 decimal. A quarter with no signups shows 0. Return one row for each country with a signup in 2025. Any row order is fine.",
